{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A  BL Horror Mystery Visual Novel!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553490/extras/e25d270ac266918f6af9eeb77b5f1f1e.avif?t=1772861531\" width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our main character's life is a mess, and just got even more complicated. \u00a0Kicked out by his ex due to his arcane 'gift' of seeing ghosts, he's forced to move into a slum. And the slumlord expects extra favors for his cheap rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One bright spot is his next door neighbor, Ethan. Or dark spot, rather, because even though he's been kind and helpful, our main character sees demons whenever he looks at the beautiful man. \u00a0And now he's learned two people were murdered in his apartment before he moved in...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror, mystery, BL romance visual novel. \u00a0Can you find the murderer before you end up the next victim? \u00a0Or will you embrace the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553490/extras/6391b470bfbc2b14877261a1d3feff13.poster.avif?t=1772861531\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553490/extras/6391b470bfbc2b14877261a1d3feff13.webm?t=1772861531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553490/extras/6391b470bfbc2b14877261a1d3feff13.mp4?t=1772861531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553490/extras/1c1f059586dafa7c876049cd25541ac1.poster.avif